#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0306 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "PLAN-scalar-date-extremes: New baseline, non-pooled: RFXENDTC 2020-01-10 equals the own latest EXENDTC (2020-01-05 and 2020-01-10) -> silent. ⚑ PLAN-join-key-one-side-absent-drop QK17 (owner 2026-10-11): the pooled arm needs POOLDEF.POOLID and EX.POOLID, so a study that defines no pools SKIPS it (judged by CDISC-SEND-0306-A; this is that rule's valid scenario)."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset DM label=Demographics
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col RFXENDTC type=Char label="Date/Time of Last Study Treatment"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | 2020-01-10
---
dataset EX class=INTERVENTIONS label="Exposure"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col POOLID  type=Char label="Pool Identifier"
col EXSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col EXTRT   type=Char label="Name of Treatment"
col EXSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Treatment"
col EXENDTC type=Char label="End Date/Time of Treatment"
---
S1 | EX | 001 |  | 1 | DRUG A | 2020-01-01 | 2020-01-05
S1 | EX | 001 |  | 2 | DRUG A | 2020-01-06 | 2020-01-10
---
